1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,689
OpenAI dots: before,

2
00:00:01,689 --> 00:00:04,270
your ChatGPT would stop, wait for you;

3
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:06,784
now your dot works 24/7,

4
00:00:06,784 --> 00:00:09,497
but how, at what risk, in 60 seconds?

5
00:00:09,997 --> 00:00:11,662
Here's how, in one shop you run.

6
00:00:11,962 --> 00:00:15,108
Old ChatGPT, even 2025's agent mode,

7
00:00:15,108 --> 00:00:16,959
was the clerk at the counter:

8
00:00:16,959 --> 00:00:18,994
you ring, it does that one task,

9
00:00:18,994 --> 00:00:20,845
then waits for the next ring.

10
00:00:21,145 --> 00:00:23,017
Go home, and no new work starts.

11
00:00:23,967 --> 00:00:25,657
Now a dot works the night shift.

12
00:00:25,957 --> 00:00:27,915
It has its own desk, a cloud computer,

13
00:00:27,915 --> 00:00:29,672
and your goals pinned on the wall.

14
00:00:29,972 --> 00:00:32,160
While you're away, it reads your connected apps,

15
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,365
but it can't send a thing.

16
00:00:33,865 --> 00:00:34,660
Morning, a note:

17
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,719
you forgot an invoice; it's ready; send it?

18
00:00:37,019 --> 00:00:37,840
You tap yes.

19
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,828
Say "shorter notes", and it learns.

20
00:00:40,128 --> 00:00:42,506
And changing a password always stays with you.

21
00:00:43,006 --> 00:00:43,439
How?

22
00:00:43,739 --> 00:00:46,097
Its own computer, working toward your goals.

23
00:00:46,397 --> 00:00:47,094
What risk?

24
00:00:47,394 --> 00:00:48,660
Away, it only reads;

25
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:50,590
it asks before sensitive steps.

26
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:52,948
It still makes mistakes, so check its work.

27
00:00:53,248 --> 00:00:54,771
The shop never closes now,

28
00:00:54,771 --> 00:00:56,463
but the keys are still yours.

29
00:00:56,963 --> 00:00:58,365
Subscribe for the next one.
